{"video_id": "tGD3653BrZ8", "channel_id": "UCXKVnF3KeF1wm3zJnMbWgHQ", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T02:15:55.457902+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "creator_uploaded", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.36, "end_seconds": 1.8, "text": "This is a simple endpoint,"}, {"start_seconds": 1.8, "end_seconds": 3.4, "text": "it has two print statements"}, {"start_seconds": 3.4, "end_seconds": 4.88, "text": "one at the start and"}, {"start_seconds": 4.88, "end_seconds": 5.96, "text": "then it waits for 5"}, {"start_seconds": 5.96, "end_seconds": 7.56, "text": "seconds and then prints the"}, {"start_seconds": 7.56, "end_seconds": 10.16, "text": "second print statement. Let's start"}, {"start_seconds": 10.16, "end_seconds": 12.2, "text": "the server. Open my browser"}, {"start_seconds": 12.2, "end_seconds": 13.12, "text": "and Go to the docs"}, {"start_seconds": 13.12, "end_seconds": 14.36, "text": "page which is at this"}, {"start_seconds": 14.36, "end_seconds": 16.4, "text": "url. If I call this"}, {"start_seconds": 16.4, "end_seconds": 18.16, "text": "endpoint once, in the terminal"}, {"start_seconds": 18.16, "end_seconds": 19.12, "text": "I can see it printing"}, {"start_seconds": 19.12, "end_seconds": 20.68, "text": "hello and then wait for"}, {"start_seconds": 20.68, "end_seconds": 22.48, "text": "5 seconds and then prints"}, {"start_seconds": 22.48, "end_seconds": 24.12, "text": "bye. What if we call"}, {"start_seconds": 24.12, "end_seconds": 25.76, "text": "the api twice within 5"}, {"start_seconds": 25.76, "end_seconds": 27.32, "text": "seconds. That is we call"}, {"start_seconds": 27.32, "end_seconds": 28.88, "text": "the api once and when"}, {"start_seconds": 28.88, "end_seconds": 29.72, "text": "it is waiting for 5"}, {"start_seconds": 29.72, "end_seconds": 31.44, "text": "seconds we call the api"}, {"start_seconds": 31.44, "end_seconds": 33.84, "text": "again. If we check, The"}, {"start_seconds": 33.84, "end_seconds": 35.52, "text": "print statements are executed in"}, {"start_seconds": 35.52, "end_seconds": 37.44, "text": "order. We have hello bye"}, {"start_seconds": 37.44, "end_seconds": 39.0, "text": "from the first request and"}, {"start_seconds": 39.0, "end_seconds": 40.0, "text": "then hello bye from the"}, {"start_seconds": 40.0, "end_seconds": 42.44, "text": "second request. It means that"}, {"start_seconds": 42.44, "end_seconds": 44.36, "text": "the fastapi first completes the"}, {"start_seconds": 44.36, "end_seconds": 46.52, "text": "first request, and then processes"}, {"start_seconds": 46.52, "end_seconds": 49.04, "text": "the second request."}, {"start_seconds": 49.04, "end_seconds": 49.72, "text": "Let's create"}, {"start_seconds": 49.72, "end_seconds": 52.08, "text": "another endpoint by copying it."}, {"start_seconds": 52.08, "end_seconds": 52.92, "text": "This time , We replace"}, {"start_seconds": 52.92, "end_seconds": 54.52, "text": "the time.sleep method with its"}, {"start_seconds": 54.52, "end_seconds": 56.32, "text": "non blocking version that is"}, {"start_seconds": 57.12, "end_seconds": 61.08, "text": "asyncio.sleep. if we call the"}, {"start_seconds": 61.08, "end_seconds": 62.76, "text": "api twice we see the"}, {"start_seconds": 62.76, "end_seconds": 64.24, "text": "hello of the 2 requests"}, {"start_seconds": 64.24, "end_seconds": 66.12, "text": "being printed first and then"}, {"start_seconds": 66.12, "end_seconds": 67.08, "text": "the bye of the two"}, {"start_seconds": 67.08, "end_seconds": 70.16, "text": "requests is printed. Clearly fastapi"}, {"start_seconds": 70.16, "end_seconds": 71.36, "text": "was able to handle the"}, {"start_seconds": 71.36, "end_seconds": 72.72, "text": "two requests at the same"}, {"start_seconds": 72.72, "end_seconds": 73.8, "text": "time."}, {"start_seconds": 73.8, "end_seconds": 75.36, "text": "Let's create another endpoint"}, {"start_seconds": 75.36, "end_seconds": 77.2, "text": "by copying the first. We"}, {"start_seconds": 77.2, "end_seconds": 78.84, "text": "make just one change, that"}, {"start_seconds": 78.84, "end_seconds": 81.76, "text": "is replace async def with"}, {"start_seconds": 81.76, "end_seconds": 85.16, "text": "just def. We repeat the"}, {"start_seconds": 85.16, "end_seconds": 86.4, "text": "experiment, that is we call"}, {"start_seconds": 86.4, "end_seconds": 87.96, "text": "the api twice within 5"}, {"start_seconds": 87.96, "end_seconds": 89.8, "text": "seconds. The output this time"}, {"start_seconds": 89.8, "end_seconds": 91.48, "text": "is hello from first and"}, {"start_seconds": 91.48, "end_seconds": 92.96, "text": "second request are printed one"}, {"start_seconds": 92.96, "end_seconds": 94.52, "text": "after the other, and then"}, {"start_seconds": 94.52, "end_seconds": 95.96, "text": "bye from the first and"}, {"start_seconds": 95.96, "end_seconds": 97.52, "text": "second request are printed next"}, {"start_seconds": 97.52, "end_seconds": 99.84, "text": "to each other. Clearly this"}, {"start_seconds": 99.84, "end_seconds": 101.24, "text": "time, the two requests were"}, {"start_seconds": 101.24, "end_seconds": 103.52, "text": "handled parallely."}, {"start_seconds": 103.52, "end_seconds": 104.16, "text": "Before I tell"}, {"start_seconds": 104.16, "end_seconds": 106.08, "text": "you how fastapi handles different"}, {"start_seconds": 106.08, "end_seconds": 108.32, "text": "requests, let's first understand the"}, {"start_seconds": 108.32, "end_seconds": 110.0, "text": "difference between the blocking and"}, {"start_seconds": 110.0, "end_seconds": 111.0, "text": "the non blocking I O"}, {"start_seconds": 111.0, "end_seconds": 112.8, "text": "bound operations."}, {"start_seconds": 113.52, "end_seconds": 114.12, "text": "Asyncio.sleep is a"}, {"start_seconds": 114.12, "end_seconds": 116.8, "text": "non-blocking I/O operation. This means"}, {"start_seconds": 116.8, "end_seconds": 118.68, "text": "it can be awaited. When"}, {"start_seconds": 118.68, "end_seconds": 120.76, "text": "you await it, the function's"}, {"start_seconds": 120.76, "end_seconds": 122.88, "text": "execution pauses while waiting for"}, {"start_seconds": 122.88, "end_seconds": 124.92, "text": "the operation to finish. During"}, {"start_seconds": 124.92, "end_seconds": 126.44, "text": "this pause, the event loop"}, {"start_seconds": 126.44, "end_seconds": 128.16, "text": "can handle other tasks, like"}, {"start_seconds": 128.16, "end_seconds": 130.36, "text": "processing other requests."}, {"start_seconds": 130.88, "end_seconds": 131.92, "text": "Time.sleep however is"}, {"start_seconds": 131.92, "end_seconds": 133.96, "text": "a blocking I/O operation. This"}, {"start_seconds": 133.96, "end_seconds": 136.28, "text": "means it cannot be awaited."}, {"start_seconds": 136.28, "end_seconds": 137.4, "text": "When you use it, the"}, {"start_seconds": 137.4, "end_seconds": 140.04, "text": "function's execution cannot be paused."}, {"start_seconds": 140.04, "end_seconds": 141.28, "text": "Instead, the event loop is"}, {"start_seconds": 141.28, "end_seconds": 142.64, "text": "blocked while waiting for the"}, {"start_seconds": 142.64, "end_seconds": 144.96, "text": "result."}, {"start_seconds": 144.96, "end_seconds": 145.96, "text": "Now, I will summarise the"}, {"start_seconds": 145.96, "end_seconds": 147.16, "text": "results for you, The requests"}, {"start_seconds": 147.16, "end_seconds": 148.36, "text": "for endpoint 1, which is"}, {"start_seconds": 148.36, "end_seconds": 150.24, "text": "defined as a coroutine using"}, {"start_seconds": 150.24, "end_seconds": 152.12, "text": "async def and doesn't contain"}, {"start_seconds": 152.12, "end_seconds": 154.36, "text": "any non-blocking I/O operations, are"}, {"start_seconds": 154.36, "end_seconds": 156.24, "text": "processed sequentially."}, {"start_seconds": 156.24, "end_seconds": 157.52, "text": "The requests for endpoint"}, {"start_seconds": 157.52, "end_seconds": 159.04, "text": "2, which is defined again"}, {"start_seconds": 159.04, "end_seconds": 161.2, "text": "as a coroutine, and it"}, {"start_seconds": 161.2, "end_seconds": 162.58, "text": "does contain non blocking I"}, {"start_seconds": 162.58, "end_seconds": 164.76, "text": "O operation, it is processed"}, {"start_seconds": 164.76, "end_seconds": 166.08, "text": "concurrently."}, {"start_seconds": 166.08, "end_seconds": 167.2, "text": "And finally, the requests"}, {"start_seconds": 167.2, "end_seconds": 169.64, "text": "for the endpoints defined as"}, {"start_seconds": 169.64, "end_seconds": 173.32, "text": "normal functions are executed parallely."}, {"start_seconds": 173.32, "end_seconds": 174.24, "text": "Let's find out why is"}, {"start_seconds": 174.24, "end_seconds": 175.68, "text": "that. When you run fastapi"}, {"start_seconds": 175.68, "end_seconds": 177.92, "text": "application using uvicorn, it starts"}, {"start_seconds": 177.92, "end_seconds": 179.84, "text": "a thread, it is referred"}, {"start_seconds": 179.84, "end_seconds": 181.4, "text": "to as the main thread."}, {"start_seconds": 181.4, "end_seconds": 183.12, "text": "All the endpoints defined as"}, {"start_seconds": 183.12, "end_seconds": 185.16, "text": "coroutines that is using async"}, {"start_seconds": 185.16, "end_seconds": 187.24, "text": "def, runs directly in the"}, {"start_seconds": 187.24, "end_seconds": 188.92, "text": "event loop which runs in"}, {"start_seconds": 188.92, "end_seconds": 191.72, "text": "the main thread."}, {"start_seconds": 191.72, "end_seconds": 192.12, "text": "With this"}, {"start_seconds": 192.12, "end_seconds": 193.08, "text": "idea in mind, we can"}, {"start_seconds": 193.08, "end_seconds": 194.16, "text": "explain the results of the"}, {"start_seconds": 194.16, "end_seconds": 196.12, "text": "first two endpoints. The first"}, {"start_seconds": 196.12, "end_seconds": 197.44, "text": "endpoint ran in the main"}, {"start_seconds": 197.44, "end_seconds": 199.22, "text": "thread, it contains no non"}, {"start_seconds": 199.22, "end_seconds": 201.04, "text": "blocking I O bound operation,"}, {"start_seconds": 201.04, "end_seconds": 202.32, "text": "so it cannot be paused"}, {"start_seconds": 202.32, "end_seconds": 203.88, "text": "in the middle. Therefore, the"}, {"start_seconds": 203.88, "end_seconds": 205.2, "text": "requests were handled in the"}, {"start_seconds": 205.2, "end_seconds": 207.32, "text": "sequential order. The second request"}, {"start_seconds": 207.32, "end_seconds": 208.6, "text": "was handled after the first"}, {"start_seconds": 208.6, "end_seconds": 210.52, "text": "request was completed. That is"}, {"start_seconds": 210.52, "end_seconds": 211.72, "text": "why we saw hello bye"}, {"start_seconds": 211.72, "end_seconds": 213.04, "text": "from the first request printed"}, {"start_seconds": 213.04, "end_seconds": 214.76, "text": "first and then hello bye"}, {"start_seconds": 214.76, "end_seconds": 215.84, "text": "from the second request were"}, {"start_seconds": 215.84, "end_seconds": 217.36, "text": "printed."}, {"start_seconds": 217.36, "end_seconds": 218.8, "text": "The second endpoint again"}, {"start_seconds": 218.8, "end_seconds": 220.28, "text": "ran in the main thread,"}, {"start_seconds": 220.28, "end_seconds": 221.92, "text": "however it contains one non"}, {"start_seconds": 221.92, "end_seconds": 223.48, "text": "blocking I O bound operation,"}, {"start_seconds": 223.48, "end_seconds": 225.52, "text": "so the function execution can"}, {"start_seconds": 225.52, "end_seconds": 227.28, "text": "be paused while event loop"}, {"start_seconds": 227.28, "end_seconds": 229.12, "text": "is waiting for its results."}, {"start_seconds": 229.12, "end_seconds": 230.08, "text": "While the event loop is"}, {"start_seconds": 230.08, "end_seconds": 231.2, "text": "waiting for the results of"}, {"start_seconds": 231.92, "end_seconds": 233.44, "text": "asyncio.sleep, it starts processing the"}, {"start_seconds": 233.44, "end_seconds": 234.96, "text": "second request, that is why"}, {"start_seconds": 234.96, "end_seconds": 236.2, "text": "we saw the two hello"}, {"start_seconds": 236.2, "end_seconds": 237.92, "text": "printed next to each other."}, {"start_seconds": 237.92, "end_seconds": 239.44, "text": "In the second request, again"}, {"start_seconds": 239.44, "end_seconds": 241.8, "text": "the execution pauses and now"}, {"start_seconds": 241.8, "end_seconds": 243.68, "text": "event loop is idle, when"}, {"start_seconds": 243.68, "end_seconds": 244.64, "text": "the results of the first"}, {"start_seconds": 244.64, "end_seconds": 247.56, "text": "requests asyncio.sleep results are available,"}, {"start_seconds": 247.56, "end_seconds": 249.0, "text": "the event loop continues the"}, {"start_seconds": 249.0, "end_seconds": 250.68, "text": "execution of the first request"}, {"start_seconds": 250.68, "end_seconds": 252.88, "text": "and prints bye, similarly when"}, {"start_seconds": 252.88, "end_seconds": 254.04, "text": "the results of the second"}, {"start_seconds": 254.04, "end_seconds": 256.96, "text": "request asyncio.sleep are available it"}, {"start_seconds": 256.96, "end_seconds": 258.36, "text": "continues the execution of the"}, {"start_seconds": 258.36, "end_seconds": 259.72, "text": "second request, and prints bye"}, {"start_seconds": 259.72, "end_seconds": 261.04, "text": "of the second request."}, {"start_seconds": 261.04, "end_seconds": 261.24, "text": "Now"}, {"start_seconds": 261.24, "end_seconds": 263.04, "text": "taking about the normal functions."}, {"start_seconds": 263.04, "end_seconds": 264.52, "text": "All the endpoints defined as"}, {"start_seconds": 264.52, "end_seconds": 266.04, "text": "normal functions are executed in"}, {"start_seconds": 266.04, "end_seconds": 267.88, "text": "a separate thread, one different"}, {"start_seconds": 267.88, "end_seconds": 269.2, "text": "from the main thread. So,"}, {"start_seconds": 269.2, "end_seconds": 270.6, "text": "when we called the second"}, {"start_seconds": 270.6, "end_seconds": 272.8, "text": "endpoint twice, two separate threads"}, {"start_seconds": 272.8, "end_seconds": 274.08, "text": "were used, this is the"}, {"start_seconds": 274.08, "end_seconds": 275.2, "text": "reason we saw the requests"}, {"start_seconds": 275.2, "end_seconds": 277.4, "text": "being handled parallely."}, {"start_seconds": 277.4, "end_seconds": 277.92, "text": "The best"}, {"start_seconds": 277.92, "end_seconds": 279.32, "text": "practice is to use async"}, {"start_seconds": 279.32, "end_seconds": 281.52, "text": "def for endpoints having a"}, {"start_seconds": 281.52, "end_seconds": 282.88, "text": "non blocking I O bound"}, {"start_seconds": 282.88, "end_seconds": 284.32, "text": "operation like a DB query"}, {"start_seconds": 284.32, "end_seconds": 286.04, "text": "or external api requests, or"}, {"start_seconds": 286.04, "end_seconds": 289.04, "text": "may be asyncio.sleep. async def"}, {"start_seconds": 289.04, "end_seconds": 289.96, "text": "should not be used for"}, {"start_seconds": 289.96, "end_seconds": 291.62, "text": "the endpoints containing blocking I"}, {"start_seconds": 291.62, "end_seconds": 294.0, "text": "O bound operation. The"}, {"start_seconds": 294.0, "end_seconds": 295.4, "text": "best scenario to use normal"}, {"start_seconds": 295.4, "end_seconds": 296.8, "text": "function is for endpoints with"}, {"start_seconds": 296.8, "end_seconds": 298.52, "text": "blocking I O operations. Like"}, {"start_seconds": 298.52, "end_seconds": 299.92, "text": "some DB client library which"}, {"start_seconds": 299.92, "end_seconds": 301.64, "text": "does not have await feature,"}, {"start_seconds": 301.64, "end_seconds": 304.56, "text": "or time.sleep. as separate threads"}, {"start_seconds": 304.56, "end_seconds": 305.68, "text": "are used for the function"}, {"start_seconds": 305.68, "end_seconds": 306.84, "text": "execution."}]}